uns from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 that same middle saw March to April at 48% and November to December at 35%, while May to June hit 186%. Grid 22407 had its driest year in 1965 at 69%. On grid 22708, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 stands at 103.1.</p>"}
